{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Due to last minute problems, game is delayed and I'm not sure when/if it will be released</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Sorry, - Enchanted Maple Studio Dev</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <i>High Intensity</i>, <i>Soul Crashing</i>, <i>Immensely Capturing</i>, <strong><i>AA Batteries</i></strong> game, you're gonna play Pool with your friends, or alone, in a bar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How can you achieve such grace, you may ask - Well through the power of <strong>stupid and funny</strong> <strong>gamemodes</strong> <i>(and maybe a little bit of alcohol)</i> you too can experience Pool games at the highest level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather up to <strong>3 of your friends</strong> and battle it out on a fair and square battlefield of <i>mind games, determination and sheer will power</i>. Whoever is able to harness the power of the physics engine the best will be victorious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The game is amazing, still don't got a girlfriend&quot;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Me, the developer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some gamemodes that are available to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice table - No friction necessary!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >randomized balls' spawns, fun for the entire family!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomize hit angle - Go up to 180 degrees, try to beat that!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be able to select all balls, Cause rules are for nerds and sabotaging is fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More/less balls rows - Go up to 10 rows (55 balls) for the most satisfying results!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix-And-Match all the options for a chaos experience that leaves everyone disappointed!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More features are to be added in the future. If you have any suggestions, feel free to contact me using email and I would be glad to listen.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921980?t=1757405066","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921980/c56f52f41cd4296d727d1406d2d3db6ae74ec8fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757405066","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921980/76ef3fb9db42e714318dd1de4d48cce52df0f42c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757405066","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921980/76ef3fb9db42e714318dd1de4d48cce52df0f42c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757405066","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Due to last minute problems, game is delayed and I'm not sure when/if it will be released</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Sorry, - Enchanted Maple Studio Dev</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <i>High Intensity</i>, <i>Soul Crashing</i>, <i>Immensely Capturing</i>, <strong><i>AA Batteries</i></strong> game, you're gonna play Pool with your friends, or alone, in a bar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How can you achieve such grace, you may ask - Well through the power of <strong>stupid and funny</strong> <strong>gamemodes</strong> <i>(and maybe a little bit of alcohol)</i> you too can experience Pool games at the highest level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather up to <strong>3 of your friends</strong> and battle it out on a fair and square battlefield of <i>mind games, determination and sheer will power</i>. Whoever is able to harness the power of the physics engine the best will be victorious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The game is amazing, still don't got a girlfriend&quot;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Me, the developer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some gamemodes that are available to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice table - No friction necessary!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >randomized balls' spawns, fun for the entire family!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomize hit angle - Go up to 180 degrees, try to beat that!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be able to select all balls, Cause rules are for nerds and sabotaging is fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More/less balls rows - Go up to 10 rows (55 balls) for the most satisfying results!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix-And-Match all the options for a chaos experience that leaves everyone disappointed!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More features are to be added in the future. If you have any suggestions, feel free to contact me using email and I would be glad to listen.</p>","developers":["Enchanted Maple Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921980/6e9f444ff58dd4037284510cead66ce38db4d65e/header.jpg?t=1757405066","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"d